      that hunt by line of sight.
    Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2abdef68be0aa434792e1822726f2134, type: 3}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 79e91cfdea848aa439c3be957956adb9, type: 3}
